  "description": "Rumors of a fire-demon resurrecting a twenty-year-old tragedy drive Prince Lee Dam deep into the Joseon wilderness to hunt the beast. But the monster he encounters is no ordinary creature. It is a massive, blue-furred beast that drags Dam into its dark cave, only to transform into a captivating man. Gyeol, the mythical Haetae, holds the prince captive with a single question: \"Are you the first prince who survived the flames?\" Entangled with a legendary entity who knows the secrets of his past, Dam must navigate a dangerous bond where mythical power and buried royal truth collide.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/ashwind)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/ashesinthewind), T.Chinese, Japanese\n\n##### Note: This series is a global release, meaning all official translations come out on the same day as the original Korean.",
